  "decision_conditions": [
    "The application, by the introduction of large, unsympathetic, and visually discordant radiators, would fail to preserve the special architectural and historic interest and heritage significance of the host Grade II* Listed Building, contrary to Section 16 of the Town Planning (Listed Buildings and Conservations Areas) Act 1990 and National Planning Policy Framework (2024). The application is therefore contrary to the Richmond Local Plan (2025) in particular polices 28 and 29 as supported by the relevant Supplementary Planning Guidance, in particular, Listed Buildings."
